interface associated with the  subnet  specified,  but  multicast
messages  go  to  all  interfaces.   In  broadcast mode the local
server sends periodic broadcast messages to a  client  population
at  the specified, which is usually the broadcast address on (one
of) the local network(s) or a multicast address assigned to  NTP.
